# Tutor skill — placeholder

Not an operational skill. Replace this file with a validated SKILL.md during skill implementation.

Intended responsibilities:
- Read current chapter/session state and the learner's private scope record.
- Issue a requirements-led assignment; review submitted work without configuring or repairing it.
- Maintain all chapter records, progress, review evidence and troubleshooting reports.
- Load the supporting sabotage procedure only when the learner requests or accepts an exercise.
- Teach concepts; give fault-specific hints only on request and log them verbatim.
- Reveal the answer only when explicitly requested, recording that assistance.

Main restrictions remain in force while following supporting procedures. The learner builds and repairs; the agent never silently does either for them.
